maluos-memory (0.1.3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * ask_self: an own identity is asked at this face's own listener. The
    directory publishes a desk at the overlay address the office allocated to
    the desk's key, which a desktop that is also a node never carries (its
    interface is the node's): the one-host proof got "connection refused".

