maluos-memory (0.1.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * The face never asks, or replicates from, this host's own identities (a desk that is
    a node too is published itself through the other membership); memory.yaml `ask_self:
    true` keeps the one-host proofs.
    A write above the writer's ceiling (the facade's check option) is refused 403
    classification instead of an internal error.

